      "compound_name": "[Dy5(LH)4(η1-Piv)(η2-Piv)3(μ2-η2η1-Piv)2(H2O)]·Cl·9.5H2O·5MeOH",
      "formula": "[Dy5(LH)4(η1-Piv)(η2-Piv)3(μ2-η2η1-Piv)2(H2O)]Cl·9.5H2O·5MeOH",
